docs {
  # Get report detail document html format by id

  This request is used to get report detail by id and all items found in the report. This request interacts with the MySQL database, and has protected routes.

  ## Path Parameters

  | Name | Type   | Required | Description | Example                               |
  |------|--------|----------|--------------|------------------------------------------|
  | id   | string | yes      | Report ID   | e1288783-a5d4-1c4c-2cd6-0e92f7cc3bf9   |

  ## Responses

  **200 — Report document generated**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "report generated",
    "data": "<p>Ini document</p>"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **404 — report document failed to generated**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "report not found"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}